    cof:title "7 Section 7" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Section 23 of the Principal Act is amended: (a) by omitting from paragraph (l)(b) \"8\" and substituting \"6\"; (b) by omitting from subsection (5) \"9\" and substituting \"7\".  Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Amendment No. 170, 1992 Payments into Fund" ;
